node_modules
# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally committed. Consumers pin this repo as a private
# git dependency (github:Tiny-Electrons-LLC/visual-capture#vX) and install it in
# CI with only the default same-org token over HTTPS - there is no cross-repo
# SSH key or `prepare`/build step available there, so the built output must be
# checked in. Run `npm run build` before tagging a release (see release note in
# package.json / README).
